// AWS IAM Managed Policy Attached to User  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1098.003
// Detects attachment of a managed policy to an IAM user (AttachUserPolicy). Used to grant additional permissions for persistence or privilege…
// False positives: Routine permission grants by identity/platform teams.
// Source: rules/persistence/iam-attach-user-policy.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName =~ "AttachUserPolicy" and eventSource =~ "iam.amazonaws.com"
